# Go backend

- Protocol encode/decode lives in `pkg/wsjtx`. Add table-driven tests there for wire format changes.
- Keep `main` as wiring; new logic belongs in packages (`internal/…` once the split todo lands).
- Audio (`malgo`) is optional/noisy — guard nil `audioManager`; prefer feature-flagging over hard dependency.
- Listen addresses via flags (`-udp`, `-http`), not hard-coded literals.
- WebSocket: avoid unbounded blocking broadcasts; use deadlines/ping when touching the hub.
- Do not expand `CheckOrigin: true` into production-trusted CORS without config.
